WEBVTT

00:00.400 --> 00:03.440
Please invite the Yan Dong envoy to the court

00:09.800 --> 00:11.200
Greetings, Your Majesty

00:12.200 --> 00:13.600
Envoy, please rise

00:17.400 --> 00:18.680
Your Majesty

00:18.760 --> 00:20.040
For decades

00:20.120 --> 00:21.400
Our Yan Dong court

00:21.560 --> 00:23.160
Has still held Xuan Kingdom's credentials

00:23.280 --> 00:25.680
And considers itself a vassal state of Xuan

00:25.760 --> 00:27.440
Now my father has sent me

00:27.520 --> 00:28.520
Hoping even more

00:28.680 --> 00:29.920
To be able to

00:30.000 --> 00:31.880
Restore our former friendship with Your Majesty

00:31.960 --> 00:34.400
We are willing to offer ten thousand fine horses

00:34.480 --> 00:35.880
To marry a princess

00:36.120 --> 00:37.520
As queen

00:37.800 --> 00:38.600
From then on

00:38.720 --> 00:39.520
With Great Xuan

00:39.640 --> 00:41.080
We will work together in harmony

00:41.160 --> 00:42.560
Sharing the same spirit

00:42.640 --> 00:44.040
And connected branches

00:47.240 --> 00:48.640
This proposal

00:49.280 --> 00:50.680
I will consider it

00:51.920 --> 00:54.040
The Yan Dong envoy has come from afar

00:54.120 --> 00:55.480
After a long journey

00:55.560 --> 00:56.480
Please

00:56.560 --> 00:58.400
Return early to rest

00:58.960 --> 01:00.360
Thank you, Your Majesty

01:05.440 --> 01:06.240
Excellent

01:06.320 --> 01:07.080
Yan Dong

01:07.160 --> 01:09.520
Is willing to help us attack Wuzhao

01:09.600 --> 01:11.040
But they want to marry a princess

01:11.160 --> 01:13.680
Isn't there only Princess Xunyang in the palace?

01:13.760 --> 01:14.840
Right

01:14.920 --> 01:16.520
Just marry Princess Xunyang off to them

01:16.600 --> 01:17.800
Alright

01:17.880 --> 01:19.547
Let's discuss the next matter

01:27.560 --> 01:28.680
Your Majesty

01:28.760 --> 01:30.760
Lady Liu is still kneeling outside

01:30.960 --> 01:32.960
We can't persuade her to leave

02:07.200 --> 02:08.600
Your Majesty

02:10.400 --> 02:13.067
When you were in Yiyang, you promised Grandfather

02:13.600 --> 02:14.920
To protect me

02:15.000 --> 02:17.000
In peace and happiness for life

02:17.600 --> 02:19.160
I want nothing

02:19.520 --> 02:21.853
I beg you, don't let Yu'er leave

02:33.520 --> 02:34.920
Rise first

02:51.680 --> 02:53.080
Your Majesty

02:53.520 --> 02:55.120
Don't let Yu'er leave

02:55.600 --> 02:56.960
I beg you

03:04.280 --> 03:05.680
Listen to me

03:06.400 --> 03:08.067
Return to the palace first

03:24.000 --> 03:25.040
Father

03:25.120 --> 03:26.880
Yan Dong has also been harassed by Wuzhao for years

03:26.960 --> 03:28.040
Your son believes

03:28.120 --> 03:30.000
If the two states can form a marriage alliance

03:30.080 --> 03:32.000
To watch over each other and together drive out Wuzhao

03:32.080 --> 03:33.747
Would be the best strategy

03:34.080 --> 03:35.200
Sikong Sheng

03:35.280 --> 03:36.560
You're a coward

03:36.640 --> 03:37.960
That's your sister

03:38.040 --> 03:39.960
How can you let her marry to a place like Yan Dong

03:40.040 --> 03:42.040
A remote and poor place to suffer

03:42.120 --> 03:43.400
With Yan Dong's assistance

03:43.480 --> 03:46.147
How many fewer of our people would die

03:46.280 --> 03:47.040
To let my sister marry far away

03:47.120 --> 03:48.920
How could I not be heartbroken

03:49.000 --> 03:50.520
But as members of the royal family

03:50.600 --> 03:53.267
Why not bear the responsibility for the people

03:54.120 --> 03:55.800
Do you think the people kneel to you

03:55.880 --> 03:56.400
Kneel to me

03:56.520 --> 03:57.920
Kneel to Princess Xunyang

04:00.680 --> 04:01.480
Father

04:01.560 --> 04:02.480
If the state and realm

04:02.640 --> 04:03.720
Must rely on Yu'er, a mere woman

04:03.800 --> 04:05.000
To bring stability and revival

04:05.080 --> 04:07.200
Then what use are all the men in court

04:07.280 --> 04:08.400
Father

04:08.480 --> 04:10.040
Your son is willing to be the vanguard

04:10.120 --> 04:11.000
On the day of the northern expedition

04:11.120 --> 04:12.520
To defeat Wuzhao

04:14.320 --> 04:15.720
Father's lifelong efforts

04:16.000 --> 04:17.520
Have all been for reviving Great Xuan

04:17.600 --> 04:19.120
You are the father of all under heaven

04:19.200 --> 04:20.400
Should not be limited to one family

04:20.480 --> 04:21.880
By personal affections

04:23.880 --> 04:25.120
All rise

04:25.200 --> 04:26.600
I

04:26.760 --> 04:28.427
Will make my own decision

04:48.080 --> 04:49.480
Your Majesty

04:49.680 --> 04:52.200
The Ministry of Rites just sent someone to ask again

04:52.280 --> 04:55.040
Only a few days left before the envoy returns

04:55.120 --> 04:56.787
We must have an answer

04:57.600 --> 04:59.000
Before

04:59.160 --> 05:01.040
I asked you to sound her out

05:01.120 --> 05:02.480
To ask Xunyang's thoughts

05:04.120 --> 05:05.520
The princess cares for Your Majesty

05:05.680 --> 05:07.000
This servant sees

05:07.080 --> 05:08.747
She is willing to go

05:10.440 --> 05:11.840
She said nothing else

05:12.280 --> 05:13.680
This

05:14.520 --> 05:15.480
To leave home thousands of miles away

05:15.560 --> 05:16.960
Sorrow is inevitable

05:17.120 --> 05:18.787
But Princess Xunyang is filial

05:19.080 --> 05:21.720
She would never go against Your Majesty's wishes
